[{"key":"SCENARIO_s41_08000000_01_0000","text":"Motion"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s41_08000000_01_0010","text":"“雨下得真大啊——\n　你没淋湿吧？”"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s41_08000000_01_0020","text":"没有……\n在躲雨……呢……"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s41_08000000_01_0030","text":"“天气预报明明没说会下雨的”"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s41_08000000_01_0040","text":"那个……\n制作人……"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s41_08000000_01_0050","text":"啊……\n稍微淋了一点，不过没事"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s41_08000000_01_0060","text":"我现在买了雾子那份的伞正赶过去\n你待在那里别动"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s41_08000000_01_0070","text":"那个……\n对不起……"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s41_08000000_01_0080","text":"……因为我……\n擅自走动了……"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s41_08000000_01_0090","text":"才会……错过了……"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s41_08000000_01_0100","text":"哈哈……\n你是来接我的吧？"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s41_08000000_01_0110","text":"不过，突然下这么大真是没想到"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s41_08000000_01_0120","text":"雾子就在那里等着\n这次换我去接你"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s41_08000000_01_0130","text":"好、好的……\n……"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s41_08000000_01_0140","text":"那、那个……我……\n会乖乖……不动的……"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s41_08000000_01_0150","text":"“哈哈……\n　好，我现在就去救你哦──”"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s41_08000000_01_0160","text":"……\n好的……！"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s41_08000000_01_0170","text":"哇……！\n又变大了……！"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s41_08000000_01_0180","text":"“是啊……雨声也……\n　好大……” "},{"key":"SCENARIO_s41_08000000_01_0190","text":"“没事，再坚持一下就好\n　先挂电话了”"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s41_08000000_01_0200","text":"嗯……"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s41_08000000_01_0001","text":"Motion"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s41_08000000_01_0210","text":"咦……"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s41_08000000_01_0220","text":"雨声……\n渐渐变小了……"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s41_08000000_01_0230","text":"……\n……Producer先生"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s41_08000000_01_0240","text":"让你久等了，抱歉\n没事吧？"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s41_08000000_01_0250","text":"……\n嗯……我……没事的……"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s41_08000000_01_0260","text":"雨，停了啊"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s41_08000000_01_0270","text":"嗯……"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s41_08000000_01_0280","text":"雨云先生也是……\n看到有困难的人……"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s41_08000000_01_0290","text":"就移动……\n到别处去了吧……"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s41_08000000_01_0300","text":"嗯……\n也许是那样呢……"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s41_08000000_01_0310","text":"不过，\n伞用不上了啊……"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s41_08000000_01_0320","text":"……我真是白忙活了一场啊\n哈哈哈……"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s41_08000000_01_0330","text":"…………"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s41_08000000_01_0340","text":"那个……\n那把伞……"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s41_08000000_01_0350","text":"如果……可以的话……\n我……"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s41_08000000_01_0360","text":"可以拿着它吗……？"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s41_08000000_01_0370","text":"嗯……？\n啊……可以啊"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s41_08000000_01_0380","text":"也许……\n还会在什么地方……"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s41_08000000_01_0390","text":"再遇到雨云先生的……"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s41_08000000_01_0400","text":"希望下次，能一起走……"}]
